      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天我实际使用从参考文献中输入的技巧，\n“针对疑问提出问题”，却让对方离开了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54f3e8ae9898b8f9d1efcc6eca280bc0ae0c893d958ec232cfdb2458367402ac",
