    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7af68f2a1af09c0fc303e8d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "况且，为女儿着想的双亲怎么可能只为了“提高社会化程度”，\n就提出“去和其他人交流”这么机械化的要求。",
      "source_fingerprint": "107abfa5c434b7410f1d672a084c132bb4e6e7db0119fdf1399ece7a4461331f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
