      "uid": "zhcn:af37a3be82f39229360d71b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "单纯是希望她可以“享受和朋友相处的时间”才对吧？\n美浦波旁听完后露出了困惑的表情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03d9ae28b87fd7d931c3c092e2d8a072cbfb41ecb3187fa9f54a8c2cfad4a737",
