      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "很抱歉这么唐突，看你每次都在做很严苛的训练，\n总是那么努力的模样让我很在意……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81b20eed3fcb5b4c1de5da0edaf39ac8bd773e793ac399ab8c8c45bb6c75b195",
